` <=> n.`Data30` AND a.`Data31` <=> n.`Data31` AND a.`Data32` <=> n.`Data32` AND a.`RequiredLevel` <=> n.`RequiredLevel` AND BINARY a.`AIName` <=> BINARY n.`AIName` AND BINARY a.`ScriptName` <=> BINARY n.`ScriptName`)));
